ontent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥之後, 有月經且大量, 出很多血塊, 比以前更大塊; 左乳硬塊縮小中;吃甲殼類後乳硬塊會加大, 吃紅肉則不會. 每次月經來後, 左乳硬塊就縮小."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠: 不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便: 淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胃口: 好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 口渴: 無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 雙足: 熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 雙手: 冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 汗: 從不出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 病人進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1) 同4/8 方再伍付  9 – 3 碗; 早晚飯前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) 同方用 caps  400 粒   8 x 3 三餐飯前服用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血虛, 建議吃紅肉  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心主月經,心臟不好致月經五年沒來 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠不好/從不出汗, 表心臟功能未完全恢復"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此女60歲了，其中五年無月經，現吃中藥每個月都有大量月經來亦把奶水排出‧"}]}]}]}]}